  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Watt’s zappin’, fam? You wanna be a Canatic?\nCome join my crew!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006100740074201900730020007A0061007000700069006E2019002C002000660061006D003F00200059006F0075002000770061006E006E006100200062006500200061002000430061006E0061007400690063003F000A0043006F006D00650020006A006F0069006E0020006D0079002000630072006500770021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Join me, join me, join meee!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006F0069006E0020006D0065002C0020006A006F0069006E0020006D0065002C0020006A006F0069006E0020006D0065006500650021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tasteless fakery.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540061007300740065006C006500730073002000660061006B006500720079002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The real Canari would never beg so shamelessly.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800650020007200650061006C002000430061006E00610072006900200077006F0075006C00640020006E0065007600650072002000620065006700200073006F0020007300680061006D0065006C006500730073006C0079002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Should’ve known ya wouldn’t be fooled, Gwynn.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530068006F0075006C00642019007600650020006B006E006F0077006E00200079006100200077006F0075006C0064006E2019007400200062006500200066006F006F006C00650064002C0020004700770079006E006E002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Still, ya gotta admit my hologram’s not a bad way\nto get the word out about my awesome grandkid!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Canari doesn’t need more bandwagoners.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430061006E00610072006900200064006F00650073006E201900740020006E0065006500640020006D006F00720065002000620061006E0064007700610067006F006E006500720073002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Canari deserves fans who adore her with their\nwhole heart—not people who fell for a hologram.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now hold on!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007700200068006F006C00640020006F006E002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You sayin’ only folks who can afford to dedicate\neverything they’ve got to Canari count as fans?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWhat about the people who just think she’s neat?\nThat sounds like a fan in my book!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 188
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You think we should accept the bandwagoners?\nUgh...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020007400680069006E006B002000770065002000730068006F0075006C006400200061006300630065007000740020007400680065002000620061006E0064007700610067006F006E006500720073003F000A005500670068002E002E002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "POPS!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050004F005000530021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You too, G-Volt. I get where you’re both comin’\nfrom, but quit arguing. I don’t like it.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I know—we oughta settle like Trainers: with a\nPokémon battle!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006B006E006F00772014007700650020006F0075006700680074006100200073006500740074006C00650020006C0069006B006500200054007200610069006E006500720073003A0020007700690074006800200061000A0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200062006100740074006C0065002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Can I join?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430061006E002000490020006A006F0069006E003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m out, bye",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D0020006F00750074002C00200062007900650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No. Help me battle them.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002E002000480065006C00700020006D006500200062006100740074006C00650020007400680065006D002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m a true Canatic, and I’ll prove it.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D0020006100200074007200750065002000430061006E0061007400690063002C00200061006E0064002000492019006C006C002000700072006F00760065002000690074002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I don’t wanna let Pops just do whatever he wants,\nbut battling Gwynn sounds pretty fun...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I stand in for Canari enough to be practically the\nreal deal! So you sorta get to fight TWO Canaris!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nCount yer lucky stars, kid!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 136
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s battle!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500742019007300200062006100740074006C006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Give me a minute",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470069007600650020006D0065002000610020006D0069006E0075007400650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Come on, battle me! You really wanna throw this\nchance away? Psh...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006D00650020006F006E002C00200062006100740074006C00650020006D0065002100200059006F00750020007200650061006C006C0079002000770061006E006E00610020007400680072006F007700200074006800690073000A006300680061006E0063006500200061007700610079003F0020005000730068002E002E002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll battle you, but I’m not gonna let you win!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C00200062006100740074006C006500200079006F0075002C0020006200750074002000492019006D0020006E006F007400200067006F006E006E00610020006C0065007400200079006F0075002000770069006E0021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Why’d you even come here, kid?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800792019006400200079006F00750020006500760065006E00200063006F006D006500200068006500720065002C0020006B00690064003F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If we win, I’m gonna turn all yer little pals into\nCanatics!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490066002000770065002000770069006E002C002000492019006D00200067006F006E006E00610020007400750072006E00200061006C006C00200079006500720020006C006900740074006C0065002000700061006C007300200069006E0074006F000A00430061006E00610074006900630073002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll prove my love like only a true Canatic can.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C002000700072006F007600650020006D00790020006C006F007600650020006C0069006B00650020006F006E006C00790020006100200074007200750065002000430061006E0061007400690063002000630061006E002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Enough playin’ around! Eelektross, let’s crank up\nthe voltage with Mega Evolution!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Excadrill, I need ya to Mega Evolve! Let’s show\nthese kids what we’re made of!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chandelure... Mega Evolve and show them our\nlove...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300680061006E00640065006C007500720065002E002E002E0020004D006500670061002000450076006F006C0076006500200061006E0064002000730068006F00770020007400680065006D0020006F00750072000A006C006F00760065002E002E002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Canari, you know I’m the truest Canatic!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430061006E006100720069002C00200079006F00750020006B006E006F0077002000492019006D00200074006800650020007400720075006500730074002000430061006E0061007400690063002100100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aw, G-Volt...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410077002C00200047002D0056006F006C0074002E002E002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But...I understand that your charms deserve to be\nshared far and wide.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Just remember: My fans are important to me, but\nnot nearly as important as you, G-Volt!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah... ♥<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006500610068002E002E002E0020266500100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But. We shouldn’t dupe people into being fans\nwith a holo-Canari.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750074002E002000570065002000730068006F0075006C0064006E2019007400200064007500700065002000700065006F0070006C006500200069006E0074006F0020006200650069006E0067002000660061006E0073000A00770069007400680020006100200068006F006C006F002D00430061006E006100720069002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ya hear that, Pops?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900610020006800650061007200200074006800610074002C00200050006F00700073003F001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Here. You both get somethin’ nice.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006500720065002E00200059006F007500200062006F00740068002000670065007400200073006F006D0065007400680069006E20190020006E006900630065002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You received additional color options for\nCanari’s Tracksuit Set!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020007200650063006500690076006500640020006100640064006900740069006F006E0061006C00200063006F006C006F00720020006F007000740069006F006E007300200066006F0072000A00430061006E0061007200692019007300200054007200610063006B0073007500690074002000530065007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I hear some people are going to salons and stylin’\ntheir hair like me. If that’s your thing.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 4860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Th-that’s an option...?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068002D00740068006100742019007300200061006E0020006F007000740069006F006E002E002E002E003F00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Obviously G-Volt and I are super tight, but I hope\nyou and me can be tight too!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I can’t believe me and the crew still couldn’t beat\nyou after all our training...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If we wanna get more fans, I think we need to do\nanother merch drop. Wonder what’d be good...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, Canari...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C002000430061006E006100720069002E002E002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    }
  ],
